{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10202","headline":"宋州东登望题武陵驿 · 李嘉佑","name":"宋州东登望题武陵驿","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"梁宋人稀鸟自啼，登舻一望倍含凄。\n白骨半随河水去，黄云犹傍郡城低。\n平陂战地花空落，旧苑春田草未齐。\n明主频移虎符守，几时行县向黔黎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李嘉佑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10202.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10202","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}